{"unit_id":"CC-play__dsh-theme-cooldark#feature-1","repo":"CC-play/dsh-theme-cooldark","commit":"00f49620a419951149ad013ef3c4e0d20ad025fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CoolDark 的功能「分层深色配色」：为画布、侧栏、对话浮层、按钮、滚动条、差异视图和代码区域提供协调的暗色令牌。插件启用时主题自动应用，无需用户单独触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:430-713","client.js:1225-1237","client.js:1295-1297"]}
{"unit_id":"CC-play__dsh-theme-cooldark#feature-2","repo":"CC-play/dsh-theme-cooldark","commit":"00f49620a419951149ad013ef3c4e0d20ad025fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CoolDark 的功能「聊天气泡描边」：为聊天气泡添加半透明 DodgerBlue 底色和浅色边框，并调整气泡里的文字与链接颜色。主题激活时自动注入样式，停用或切换主题后移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:286-293","client.js:835-851","client.js:1125-1144","client.js:1289-1292"]}
{"unit_id":"CC-play__dsh-theme-cooldark#feature-3","repo":"CC-play/dsh-theme-cooldark","commit":"00f49620a419951149ad013ef3c4e0d20ad025fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CoolDark 的功能「Markdown 层级着色」：为 Markdown 标题、无序与有序列表标记、粗体强调设置不同颜色，让内容层次更易辨认。样式随主题注入到 DSH 页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:318-328","client.js:861-884","client.js:1052-1053"]}
{"unit_id":"CC-play__dsh-theme-cooldark#feature-4","repo":"CC-play/dsh-theme-cooldark","commit":"00f49620a419951149ad013ef3c4e0d20ad025fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CoolDark 的功能「输入框聚焦光晕」：当输入卡片内的编辑器或控件获得焦点时，在保留原有阴影的同时显示柔和的白色边缘和扩散光晕。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:805-831","client.js:819-832","client.js:1052-1053"]}
{"unit_id":"CC-play__dsh-theme-cooldark#feature-5","repo":"CC-play/dsh-theme-cooldark","commit":"00f49620a419951149ad013ef3c4e0d20ad025fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CoolDark 的功能「设置后保持主题」：插件监听 theme/change，并区分显式切换与设置写入或重连带来的偏好恢复；在用户未选择其他主题且 CoolDark 已注册时重新应用主题。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1177-1186","client.js:1197-1209","client.js:1270-1293"]}
